Now Double buffering and synchronization with the monitor's 60 Hz: While KMS displays buffer A, Pixman draws in buffer B. We then request to switch to B and wait for kernel confirmation before reusing A.
The response time should be approximately 16.665 ms.
The program will attempt to display the same rectangles we drew with Pixman for three seconds and then restore the previous mode.
